 surround."},{"value":"modern","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"marble","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"white","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"gray","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"wood cabinets","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"brown","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"clean lines","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"minimal","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"backsplash","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"countertop","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."},{"value":"stove","rationale":"Selected from Workers AI visual analysis based on style theme Modern; materials marble, wood; visible elements marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround."}],"note":{"value":"Theme: Modern • Materials: marble, wood • Focus: marble countertop, marble backsplash, marble stove surround, wood cabinets","rationale":"Generated from Workers AI visual summary to speed up review coding."},"roomType":{"value":"Kitchen","rationale":"Predicted from visual layout and room-defining elements in the image."},"displayName":{"value":"Modern White Gray Marble Kitchen","rationale":"Suggested from room context and focal elements to provide a unique review label."}},"assignedRoomType":"Kitchen","assignedRoomId":null}',0,1781625285,'inspirational',NULL,'Backwall Countertop','IMG_7081.PNG','img_7081.png',4650301,'b73c039421417f551e5f3b5f3dc63d4f',0,NULL,NULL,replace('We would like to aim for this look -- \n\nTBD on cooktop due to gas or electrical decision. \n\nOur preference initially was for invisacook cooktop but we didn''t like the limited stone materials required for invisacook to work. \n\nAn integrated cooking range would be ideal -- like the one pictured here or even the gas range where there are just gas cook top circles poking out of the stone -- but TBD whether we would also need to decide this together with our stone selection. \n\nAlso, we have a Bertazzoni Range and Oven now, we could just keep that.\n\nIf we didn''t keep the Bertazzoni and went with a cooktop integrated with countertop -- we would need to find a placement for an oven. \n\nBertazzoni Pros:\n - Save $$ and apply in other kitchen areas\n - Could leverage gas and minimize constraint against electrical panel \n - Has an integrated oven which helps solve that question of where we place the oven -- yet another savings\n\nBertazzoni Cons:\n - Practically speaking, it would be very hard to keep clean and then when we clean it we would have to be very careful with how we clean it because placing the metal grates on the stone or floor could scratch either of those surfaces\n - Grease and crumbs can run between the cracks of the counter top and the cooktop very easily','\n',char(10)),1,1781771302,'room',NULL,NULL);
